<title>SLOVENIA: BASKETBALL-OLIMPIJA LJUBLJANA BEAT BAYER LEVERKUSEN.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-OLIMPIJA LJUBLJANA BEAT BAYER LEVERKUSEN.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a men's EuroLeague basketball championship group C match played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Olimpija Ljubljana (Slovenia) 86 Bayer Leverkusen (Germany) 70 (halftime 44-33)</p>
<p>Leading scorers: </p>
<p>Olimpija - Marko Milic (20)</p>
<p>Bayer Leverkusen - Tony Dawson (17), Kevin Pritchard (17)</p>
<p>Attendance: 4,000</p>
